# Code Economy Rules

0. Does this code need to exist? Delete first.
1. Can native JS/React do this? No library.
2. Can I reuse existing code? Search the codebase.
3. Use arrow functions for simple handlers.
4. Inline simple styles, extract complex ones.
5. Delete dead code (console.log, commented code).
6. Use native CSS when Tailwind not worth it.

**Target:** Half the lines, same behavior.